			flags.AdminKey,
			flags.AdminSubject,
			flags.AdminProvisioner,
			flags.AdminPasswordFile,
			flags.CaURL,
			flags.Root,
			flags.Context,
		},
		Description: `**step ca acme eab add** adds ACME External Account Binding Key.

## POSITIONAL ARGUMENTS

<provisioner>
